      <h2 id="challenges">Common Technical and Commercial Challenges</h2>
      <p>Many aerosol failures in deodorant and body spray production are not due to formulation errors but to system mismatches or process oversights that only become apparent after scale-up or in real-world consumer use. Understanding common failure modes allows teams to design proactively against them, saving significant development cost and time to market. The <a href="/aerosol-manufacturing-101-guide/" target="_top">aerosol manufacturing fundamentals guide</a> covers process control principles applicable to all personal care aerosol categories.</p>

