      <h2 id="market-trends">Market Trends and Innovation in Personal Care Aerosols</h2>
      <p>Innovation in personal care aerosols is driven by regulatory pressure, sustainability goals, and changing consumer expectations around ingredient transparency and environmental impact. While the fundamental aerosol system — pressurised can, valve, propellant — remains unchanged, design priorities continue to evolve. Low-VOC formulations using compressed gas propellants, aluminium can recycling programmes, and concentrated refill systems are among the trends reshaping the category. European market trend data from the <a href="https://aerosol.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FEA (European Aerosol Federation)</a> provides quantitative insight into sustainable aerosol packaging adoption rates.</p>

