      <h2 id="startups">How Startups Can Enter the Deodorant &amp; Body Spray Market</h2>
      <p>Market entry in the deodorant and body spray aerosol category requires strategic alignment of product design, manufacturing strategy, and regulatory readiness from day one. The most common entry pathway for startups and new brands is through contract aerosol manufacturing, which avoids the capital investment in filling infrastructure while allowing the brand to focus on formulation, packaging differentiation, and commercial strategy. For an early-stage team considering this pathway, our guide on <a href="/choosing-the-right-product-consultant/" target="_top">choosing the right aerosol technical consultant</a> explains how experienced aerosol consultants add measurable value during the critical R&amp;D and scale-up phases.</p>

